<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00118/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>項目描述：</strong>一頭荷魯斯泰因（Holstein）品種奶牛，無法正常擠奶；每次打嗝時會從口中產生凝結後為一公升的牛奶氣體。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/9/17<br />
<strong>回收地點：</strong>中國內蒙古[已編輯]牧場<br />
<strong>當前狀態：</strong>由威爾遜野生動物中國分區管理中</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00118" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00118" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00118-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2941964); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2941964&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606789823" alt="M Element" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2941964)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/m-element" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2941964); return false;">M Element</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587909108 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Apr 2020 13:51</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00403/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一对████公司出品的运动型护腕，其异常表现为会将佩戴者手腕扭伤这一事件发生的概率提高到100%。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Area-CN-15的运动馆内。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>活动活动手腕都能扭伤是不是有点太过分了。&#8212;Dr.K</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00403" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00403" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00403-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606789823" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1600831602 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Sep 2020 03:26</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张████餐馆的菜单，任何人类在观察项目时，项目上的菜品都会变成此人最喜欢吃的东西，当有人在菜品后的方框中打勾时，此人的面前就会出现刚刚勾选的菜品<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市████餐馆中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于site—██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>嘿，终于不用忍受食堂那可怕的饭菜了！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+实验记录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;实验记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>当使用机器人在菜单上勾选时，会在空中出现一行字：“机器人不用吃饭”语言随观察者而变化</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00111" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
